coordinate values. They refuse to change.

14:49.940 --> 14:52.280
Okay. The anchors are frozen.

14:52.280 --> 14:57.720
Then every interior processor wakes up, looks at the current coordinate values of all its immediate

14:57.720 --> 15:03.360
neighbors, calculates their mathematical mean, and completely replaces its own value with that

