17:54.220 --> 17:58.880
Which brings us to Section 3 of the essay's analysis, the quilt that won't lie flat,

17:59.480 --> 18:04.260
because stitching these small maps together introduces a massive topological vulnerability

18:04.260 --> 18:07.900
regarding our main theme, the illusion of agreement.

18:08.400 --> 18:13.660
We transition from creating coordinates to the problem of compatibility on overlaps.

18:13.660 --> 18:20.240
The essay formally calls this the assembly problem. We have all these local smooth patches. Let's

18:20.240 --> 18:26.540
imagine three of them. Region 1, Region 2, and Region 3. They aren't isolated islands. Their edges

