19:25.040 --> 19:31.440
The essay distinguishes between two fundamentally different tests for consistency in this assembly

19:31.440 --> 19:35.840
process. The first is called the domain defect. Let's define the domain defect.

19:36.560 --> 19:42.080
The domain defect measures the consistency of the mathematical fits on the actual shared overlapping

19:42.080 --> 19:48.640
areas. It asks a purely local question. Right here, in the specific boundary zone where Region 1 and Region 2

